>> i := 0.
Sephetho ngola: ['Can we count to 10 using a whileTrue loop ?'], mola-o-mocha.
{ Sephetho ngola: i, mola-o-mocha. } ha-feela: { i eketsa: 1. <- (i ≤ 10). }.
Sephetho ngola: ['Can we count back from 10 to 0 using a whileFalse loop ?'], mola-o-mocha.
{ Sephetho ngola: i, mola-o-mocha. } ha-feela: { i tlosa: 1. <- (i ≥ 0). }.
